          "effectiveUntil": "9999-12-31",
          "status": "estimated"
        },
        "note": "Managed service of the Creative practice priced at its margin floor: target margin 45% on all costs, never below 45%. The floor was approved on 2026-07-13; applying it to a given engagement remains a per-case review, not an approved price."
